The FS19xx amplifiers (Fs19xx.{h,c}, tests/fs19xx_host.c) and the preset identity (AudioSha256.{h,c}): new code, from facts.
  Specifications only (GPL-2.0, behaviour and register positions as facts; no code, comment or table copied): yzddmr6/linux-sm8750-piano
  sound/soc/codecs/fs19xx.c (sha256 cc758c6b4e5d2b7585b98a72d25c0c215f66b7a573740c964e675c42aefc79e3) and the same driver in
  Project-SunUEFI 0005-audio.patch: the register addresses and bits, the 8-bit address / 16-bit big-endian register format, DEVID and
  REVID, the soft reset (unacknowledged I2CR, CHIPINI 0x0003/0x0300), the configure order (speaker coefficient, common table, music
  scene, shut down), the start order (sample rate field and data out, the PLL under the OTP access key: one row, 6.144 MHz; blocks
