docs/drivers/audio.md 10.2 and Ubuntu's device/audio/README.md (tones <= -20 dBFS, <= 3 s, 5 s watchdog, 20 ms ramps as its
speaker-playback-check.py writes them); the slot order FL FR LS RS from its machine driver (specification only).

